Relevant columns and their potential usage  
• `game_id`: link plays back to a single game (needed to count attempts / made shots per‑game).  
• `scheduled_date`: filter out shots that occurred on or after 2018‑03‑15.  
• `season`: optional season filter / sanity check.  
• `shot_type`: category we will group by (jump‑shot, layup, hook‑shot, dunk, tip‑shot, etc.).  
• `shot_made`: Boolean flag –  TRUE ⇒ made basket, FALSE ⇒ missed.  
• `event_coord_x`, `event_coord_y`: raw Sportradar shot‐location in inches (0–1128, 0–600).  
• `team_basket`: tells whether the offence is attacking the “left” or “right” basket.  
• `period`, `game_clock`: additional play context (not strictly required).  

Main filters / conditions  
1. `shot_type IS NOT NULL`  
2. `event_coord_x IS NOT NULL AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL`  
3. `scheduled_date < '2018‑03‑15'` (UTC)  
4. Keep only shots that occurred on the proper half of the court w.r.t. `team_basket`:  
   – `team_basket = 'left'  AND event_coord_x < 564`  
   – `team_basket = 'right' AND event_coord_x >= 564`  
5. Build “flipped” (consistent) coordinates using the given rule:  
   – `adj_x = IF(event_coord_x < 564, event_coord_x, 1128 - event_coord_x)`  
   – `adj_y = IF(event_coord_x < 564, 600 - event_coord_y, event_coord_y)`  

Below are ten example BigQuery SQL snippets that gradually explore the data and finally answer the question.  
(Replace nothing – dataset and table names are already the real ones.)  

```sql
-- 1. Description: List distinct shot types that actually appear in play‑by‑play.
SELECT DISTINCT shot_type
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
WHERE shot_type IS NOT NULL
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2. Description: Inspect a few rows that already satisfy basic filters.
SELECT game_id,
       scheduled_date,
       team_basket,
       shot_type,
       shot_made,
       event_coord_x,
       event_coord_y
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
WHERE shot_type IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_x IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL
  AND scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3. Description: Check how many shots come from the left vs. right basket after 2010.
SELECT team_basket,
       COUNT(*) AS shots
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
WHERE scheduled_date >= '2010-01-01'
  AND scheduled_date <  '2018-03-15'
  AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY team_basket
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4. Description: Verify that the "half‑court" filter keeps plays on the correct side.
SELECT team_basket,
       SUM(CASE WHEN event_coord_x < 564 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS on_left_side,
       SUM(CASE WHEN event_coord_x >= 564 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS on_right_side
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
WHERE scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
  AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY team_basket
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5. Description: Compute raw (un‑flipped) average coordinates by shot type.
SELECT shot_type,
       AVG(event_coord_x) AS avg_x_raw,
       AVG(event_coord_y) AS avg_y_raw,
       COUNT(*)           AS total_attempts
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
WHERE scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
  AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_x IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY shot_type
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6. Description: Add the flipped/adjusted coordinates (rule given).
SELECT shot_type,
       AVG(
         IF(event_coord_x < 564, event_coord_x, 1128 - event_coord_x)
       ) AS avg_adj_x,
       AVG(
         IF(event_coord_x < 564, 600 - event_coord_y, event_coord_y)
       ) AS avg_adj_y
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
WHERE scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
  AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_x IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL
GROUP BY shot_type
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7. Description: Keep only shots that occur on the correct half of the court.
SELECT shot_type,
       COUNT(*) AS kept_shots
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
WHERE scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
  AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_x IS NOT NULL
  AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL
  AND (
        (team_basket = 'left'  AND event_coord_x < 564) OR
        (team_basket = 'right' AND event_coord_x >= 564)
      )
GROUP BY shot_type
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8. Description: Derive per‑game counts of attempts and makes for every shot type.
WITH game_level AS (
  SELECT game_id,
         shot_type,
         COUNT(*)                     AS attempts,
         SUM(CASE WHEN shot_made THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS made
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
  WHERE scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
    AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
    AND event_coord_x IS NOT NULL
    AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL
    AND (
          (team_basket = 'left'  AND event_coord_x < 564) OR
          (team_basket = 'right' AND event_coord_x >= 564)
        )
  GROUP BY game_id, shot_type
)
SELECT *
FROM game_level
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9. Description: Average the per‑game attempts and makes across all games.
WITH game_level AS (
  SELECT game_id,
         shot_type,
         COUNT(*)                     AS attempts,
         SUM(CASE WHEN shot_made THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS made
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
  WHERE scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
    AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
    AND event_coord_x IS NOT NULL
    AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL
    AND (
          (team_basket = 'left'  AND event_coord_x < 564) OR
          (team_basket = 'right' AND event_coord_x >= 564)
        )
  GROUP BY game_id, shot_type
)
SELECT shot_type,
       AVG(attempts) AS avg_attempts_per_game,
       AVG(made)     AS avg_made_per_game
FROM game_level
GROUP BY shot_type
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--10. Description: FINAL – combine adjusted X/Y and average attempts & makes for each shot type.
WITH valid_shots AS (
  SELECT game_id,
         shot_type,
         IF(event_coord_x < 564, event_coord_x, 1128 - event_coord_x) AS adj_x,
         IF(event_coord_x < 564, 600 - event_coord_y, event_coord_y) AS adj_y,
         shot_made
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.ncaa_basketball.mbb_pbp_sr`
  WHERE scheduled_date < '2018-03-15'
    AND shot_type IS NOT NULL
    AND event_coord_x IS NOT NULL
    AND event_coord_y IS NOT NULL
    AND (
          (team_basket = 'left'  AND event_coord_x < 564) OR
          (team_basket = 'right' AND event_coord_x >= 564)
        )
),
per_game AS (
  SELECT game_id,
         shot_type,
         COUNT(*)                                       AS attempts,
         SUM(CASE WHEN shot_made THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)     AS made,
         AVG(adj_x) AS avg_x,
         AVG(adj_y) AS avg_y
  FROM valid_shots
  GROUP BY game_id, shot_type
)
SELECT shot_type,
       AVG(avg_x)      AS avg_x_coord,
       AVG(avg_y)      AS avg_y_coord,
       AVG(attempts)   AS avg_attempts,
       AVG(made)       AS avg_made
FROM per_game
GROUP BY shot_type
ORDER BY shot_type;
```

